OL,3,GNEWSADrugs and guns seized during
OL,4,Across-border operation
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested following a
OL,7,Fjoint cross-border police operation.
OL,9,FA man in his 40s was arrested in County
OL,10,FLouth on suspicion of drug trafficking
OL,11,Fafter Gardai (Irish police) uncovered
OL,12,F119kg (262lb) of cannabis in Dundalk,
OL,13,FCounty Louth, after a car was stopped
OL,14,Fon Wednesday. The estimated street
OL,15,Fvalue is bB,1.6m (#1.4m).
OL,17,FFollow up searches were conducted in
OL,18,FNewtownabbey, County Antrim, where a
OL,19,Ffurther 45kg of cannabis, half a
OL,20,Fkilogram of suspected cocaine and 22
OL,21,Fimitation firearms were seized, along
OL,22,Fwith #25,000 in cash.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
